                            </div>
                            <button type="submit"
                                class="w-full py-3 px-6 rounded-lg text-white font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8C6A5D] to-[#73564B] hover:from-[#73564B] hover:to-[#8C6A5D] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-[#8C6A5D] transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
                                Login
