                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>


            <div id="signup-panel" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex justify-center items-center translate-x-full transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out">
                <div class="w-full max-w-sm px-6">
                    <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-2 text-center">Create Account</h3>
                    <p class="text-text-secondary mb-8 text-center">Join the Nanshhuf family.</p>
                    <form id="signup-form">
